{% if render_mode == "full" %}
    ### RELATIONSHIP STATUS SCALE (low to high commitment):
    0. Hookup  — one or a few sexual encounters, no ongoing bond, purely physical, may never repeat
    1. Lover   — recurring sexual partners, low emotional investment, NOT exclusive, NOT a couple
    2. Dating  — recurring sexual/romantic partners WITH emotional commitment and some exclusivity, but not publicly declared or formalized
    3. Engaged — publicly committed, intends marriage
    4. Married — fully committed, legally/socially bonded

    IMPORTANT: This scale intentionally differs from real-world colloquial usage.
    "Lover" here is LESS committed than "Dating" — it is the casual/physical tier.
    "Dating" here is MORE committed than "Lover" — it includes emotional attachment and quasi-exclusivity.
    Do not apply real-world assumptions where "lover" implies devotion or "dating" implies casualness.
{% endif %}

